New Booking Assigned to You

Hello <%= @user.first_name || @user.email %>,

A new booking has been assigned to you for processing.

Booking Details:
- Booking ID: #<%= @booking.id.to_s.first(8) %>
- Customer: <%= @booking.user.first_name || @booking.user.email %>
- Product: <%= @booking.product_name || @product&.name || "N/A" %>
- Period: <%= @booking.start_at.strftime("%B %d, %Y") %> - <%= @booking.end_at.strftime("%B %d, %Y") %>
- Total: <%= number_to_currency(@booking.total_price) %>

Items in this booking:
<% @booking_items.each do |item| %>
- <%= item.variant_stock_option_names || "Item" %>
  Quantity: <%= item.quantity %>
  Price: <%= number_to_currency(item.price) %>
  <% if item.variant_stock_warehouse_name %>Warehouse: <%= item.variant_stock_warehouse_name %><% end %>
<% end %>

Fulfillments:
<% @fulfillments.each do |fulfillment| %>
- Warehouse: <%= fulfillment.warehouse&.name || "N/A" %>
  Status: <%= fulfillment.status.humanize %>
  <% if fulfillment.delivery_date %>Delivery Date: <%= fulfillment.delivery_date.strftime("%B %d, %Y") %><% end %>
<% end %>

Please review this booking and update its status as you process it.

View booking: <%= @booking_url %>

Best regards,
The Platinum Vault Team
